              If  enabled,  extended  statistics  are  printed  from _l_o_c_a_l_-_u_n_‐
              _b_o_u_n_d_-_c_o_n_t_r_o_l(8).  Default is off, because keeping track of more
              statistics  takes  time.   The  counters are listed in _l_o_c_a_l_-_u_n_‐
              _b_o_u_n_d_-_c_o_n_t_r_o_l(8).

